      "en": "<pre class=\"code-block\"><code>n8n-workflow-review/\n└── SKILL.md          ← the only required file\n\n# SKILL.md contents\n---\nname: n8n-workflow-review\ndescription: When a user provides n8n workflow JSON, check its structure—\n  find dangling connections, missing credentials, and clear performance problems.\n  Also trigger when the user asks “Does this workflow have a problem?” or “Review this.”\n---\n\n# n8n Workflow Review\n\n(Instructions for the agent, written as if onboarding a colleague)</code></pre>"
